    {
      "id": "claim_9ab868a6b7024fefad11bf82d53d5ad2",
      "statement": "AuditLog supports two modes: memory mode (AuditLog(memory=True)) accumulates entries in a list and is what the tests inject, and it is also HAAPServer's fallback when constructed without an audit argument (server.py defaults to AuditLog(memory=True)); the real 'haap serve' command constructs a file-mode AuditLog bound to the agent directory.",
      "evidence": [
