    {
      "id": "claim_95d96488224e468f8460346dc6acccb0",
      "statement": "Audit entries are read back through AuditLog.recent(), which in file mode re-reads and parses the whole log per call (skipping malformed lines), sorts by ts, filters by since-timestamp/friend fingerprint/event-name prefix, and returns the newest last entries; the CLI exposes this as 'haap audit [--last N] [--friend FP]'.",
